t equation, we have ${x}_{2}=0.$ \n\nSo, the general solution is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]={x}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{1}\\in R.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the required basis is \n\n$$\nB={[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}.\n$$" 13194139535709 true] [17592186362510 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362511 13194139535709 true] [17592186362510 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362512 13194139535709 true] [17592186362510 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362513 13194139535709 true] [17592186362510 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362514 13194139535709 true] [17592186362510 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362515 13194139535709 true] [17592186362510 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535709 true] [17592186362510 1041 "selection" 13194139535709 true] [17592186362510 1104 #edb/ref 17592186362511 13194139535709 true] [17592186362510 1110 #uuid "056e4973-b3de-536d-ae0c-527176ba6484" 13194139535709 true] [17592186362511 1034 "{[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}" 13194139535709 true] [17592186362511 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535709 true] [17592186362511 1111 #uuid "8002d190-9e27-5d3b-a46f-2b44d443d6c8" 13194139535709 true] [17592186362512 1034 "{[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}" 13194139535709 true] [17592186362512 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535709 true] [17592186362512 1111 #uuid "bd36c3e5-37c5-524e-8185-a8a62fda48f4" 13194139535709 true] [17592186362513 1034 "{[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}" 13194139535709 true] [17592186362513 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535709 true] [17592186362513 1111 #uuid "76108305-c155-5cbc-910a-bd5756aecb66" 13194139535709 true] [17592186362514 1034 "{[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}" 13194139535709 true] [17592186362514 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535709 true] [175921863